      "projectTypeKey": "business",
      "simplified": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
        "48x48": "https://metricell.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/universal_avatar/view/type/project/avatar/10400",
        "24x24": "https://metricell.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/universal_avatar/view/type/project/avatar/10400?size=small",
        "16x16": "https://metricell.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/universal_avatar/view/type/project/avatar/10400?size=xsmall",
        "32x32": "https://metricell.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/universal_avatar/view/type/project/avatar/10400?size=medium"
      }
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Exercise map navigation while a real layer is loaded, rather than testing an empty map."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Environment: https://o2intelligence-v4-dev.metricell.com/launcher. Use existing authorised access. Open GIS and add one test-created Surveyor layer using the default configuration. Record its visible identity, Map layers entry/legend and the current Show linked sites checkbox state in Display Settings. Close Display Settings before zooming. Do not modify or remove layers belonging to other users."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "order": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The test-created Surveyor layer is visibly identifiable in Map layers or the legend, and its Display Settings shows an identifiable Show linked sites state."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "From a recorded settled map scale with that layer loaded, selecting zoom-in once produces a closer settled map scale; the same Surveyor layer remains visible in Map layers or the legend."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "After that zoom-in, selecting zoom-out once returns to the recorded initial map scale, and the same loaded layer remains available without adding it again."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Opening Display Settings for the same layer after the zoom-in/zoom-out journey shows the originally recorded Show linked sites state."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Evidence: each comparison must show its own before and after states, including scale and layer identity. No claim about linked-site data completeness or persistence across reload/login. If prerequisite data is unavailable, identify it rather than substitute another feature. Restore the original checkbox and remove only the layer created for this test."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "assignee": null,
